{"t":"Squeezing Gear of Girlpower","s":"squeezing-gear-of-girlpower-ac5da","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Squeezing_Gear_of_Girlpower_468bad.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Squeezing Gear of Girlpower</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Squeezing Gear of Girlpower\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Squeezing_Gear_of_Girlpower_468bad.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tools and other Equipment<br/>Tools</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">125,000 - 200,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090624185917&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Squeezing_Gear_of_Girlpower_468bad.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a squeezing gear of girlpower.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 3.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This nifty gadget can be used for many vital and less vital purposes. If it's not jammed, that is.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Obtainable by opening CGB's <a href=\"#/wiki/Mysterious%20Package\">Mysterious Package</a>. You need to have the <a href=\"#/quest/secret-service-quest\">Secret Service Quest</a> completed to be able to open the package, and it needs to correspond to the package you want to open.<br/>Can be used as <a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a>, but not as a melee weapon to destroy objects. You must always keep in mind that this item can jam whenever you use it and can then not be used for 1 minute. It will show this message when you try to use it while jammed: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">Oh no! Your tool is jammed and can't be used for a minute.</span><br/>It's a good idea to always carry a rope and shovel with you even if you have this item.\nCan be gotten through the <a href=\"#/quest/secret-service-quest\">Secret Service Quest</a>.<br/>\nCan be used to open 500 <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Piles</a> in order to gain the The Undertaker achievement.<br/>\nCan also be used to cut <a href=\"#/wiki/Jungle%20Grass\">Jungle Grass</a> 100 times in order to gain the Nothing Can Stop Me achievement.<br/>\nCan also be used to cut <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a> 200 times in order to gain the Happy Farmer achievement.<br/>\nCan also be used to cut <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Cane</a> 50 times in order to gain the Natural Sweetener achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Flooring</li><li>Grass</li><li>Happy Farmer</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Juice%20Squeezer\">Juice Squeezer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jungle%20Grass\">Jungle Grass</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Pile</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a></li><li>Mysterious Package (AVIN)</li><li>Mysterious Package (CGB)</li><li>Mysterious Package (TBI)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/secret-service-quest\">Secret Service Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a></li><li>Squeezing Gear of Girlpower (Jammed)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Cane</a></li><li>Tools</li><li>Venorean Spice</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["secret-service-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"secret-service-quest","quest":"Secret Service Quest","step":"0-0","n":1,"title":"Comparar as recompensas","kind":"reward","coords":[]},{"slug":"secret-service-quest","quest":"Secret Service Quest","step":"22-0","n":101,"title":"Usar o pacote","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}